    heroHeadline: 'Your photos, only for the people you choose.',
    heroSubtitle: "XowApp is the private album you send directly, from your phone to the one you choose — without uploading it anywhere you don't control.",
    hero_manifesto: 'It\'s "SHOWING", not sharing.',
    whatis_kicker: 'What it is',
    whatis_title: 'Showing your photos and videos, not handing them out',
    whatis_body: "XowApp is an app that lets you show your photos and videos to whoever you choose, straight on their device — without uploading them to a social network or a cloud you don't control, and without them turning into a copy that stops being yours. Showing isn't the same as sharing: you're still the one deciding what's seen, who sees it, and for how long.",
    how_kicker: 'How it works',
    how_title: 'Three steps, zero complications',
    how_step1_title: '1. Create an album',
    how_step1_body: "Choose who can see it. No one else gets in unless you invite them.",
    how_step2_title: '2. Share directly',
    how_step2_body: 'Photos and videos travel encrypted from your device to theirs. Not even we can see them.',
    how_step3_title: '3. Stay in control',
    how_step3_body: "Decide what's kept, what expires and what gets deleted. Delete means delete — for real.",
    teaser_kicker: 'Before you go on',
    teaser_title: 'The origin of XowApp',
    teaser_body: "XowApp was born to solve a very real problem: not knowing what happens to your photos the moment they leave your hands. But it also came from something simpler — a developer's own excitement about building something he genuinely believes in. We tell the full story and what we believe in — no rush, whenever you feel like it.",
    teaser_cta_story: 'Read our story',
